# Copied to `.env`, this is read by both toolchains: `pnpm build` / `pnpm start` (next build, next
# start) and `pnpm build:vinext` / `pnpm start:vinext` (vite build, vinext start). Give the server
# the same values as the build: the prerendered HTML has them baked in.

# The site's own origin. It drives `metadataBase`, every `<link rel="canonical">`, the absolute
# URLs in sitemap.xml, the `Host`/`Sitemap` lines in robots.txt and the OG image URLs.
#
# There is no production domain in the repo, so the fallback is localhost (see
# components/layout/site-url.ts): set this in the deploy environment BEFORE the first production
# build or the shipped HTML will point at http://localhost:3000. No trailing slash.
SITE_URL=https://example.com

# Optional, CI only: pins the instant the "stale snapshot" notice is measured against
# (components/layout/build-instant.ts), so two builds of one commit are byte-identical.
# SCVAL_BUILD_AT=2026-09-30T00:00:00.000Z

# Optional: read a snapshot from somewhere other than data/snapshot.json (lib/data.ts).
# SCVAL_SNAPSHOT=/absolute/path/to/snapshot.json
